intro = "An Unfolding: a tight-curled thing that should not hold as much as it does. Curled, blows barely scratch it; when it unfolds, it reaches a length no curl could hold, all the way to the back row. Strike while it's open. (Stand-in model until its own is made.)"
loot_line = "Where the Unfolding lay curled: %s."
